OL,4,Avoted off Strictly
OL,5,
OL,6,FGavin and Stacey's Melanie Walters has
OL,7,Fbecome the second celebrity eliminated
OL,8,Ffrom this season of Strictly Come
OL,9,FDancing.
OL,11,FThe actress, 64, had been paired with
OL,12,Fprofessional dancer Aljaz Skorjanec,
OL,13,F36.
OL,15,FOn Saturday night's episode, Walters
OL,16,Fand Skorjanec had performed a
OL,17,FCharleston to Ooh Ahh... Just A Little
OL,18,FBit by Gina G, receiving a score of 17
OL,19,Ffrom the judges.
